{"schema_version":1,"timestamp":"2026-11-03T09:17:54-05:00","cwd":"{NEBULA_PRODUCT_ROOT}","command":"python3 -c 'from pathlib import Path\nfrom datetime import datetime,timezone\nimport hashlib,json,xml.etree.ElementTree as ET\np=Path(\"/home/gajap/uSandbox/repos/nebula/nebula-insurance-brain\");run=p/\"planning-mds/operations/evidence/runs/2026-11-02-5a00b0ff\"\nstamp=datetime.now(timezone.utc).isoformat(timespec=\"seconds\")\nf=run/\"architect-implementation-review.md\";t=f.read_text()\nt=t.replace(\"- Review date: 2026-11-03\",\"- Review date: \"+stamp)\nt=t.replace(\"- Verdict: PENDING \u2014 A-IMPL-01 requires repair and observed PostgreSQL proof.\",\"- Verdict: PASS\\n- Open findings: critical=0; high=0; medium=0; low=0. A-IMPL-01 (High) was repaired and independently re-reviewed.\")\nt=t.replace(\"The page/bbox INSERT-integrity omission below is the outstanding correction to this assessment.\",\"The page/bbox INSERT-integrity omission below was repaired and its positive/negative PostgreSQL proof passes.\")\nt=t.replace(\"## Finding A-IMPL-01 \u2014 High \u2014 Open\",\"## Finding A-IMPL-01 \u2014 High \u2014 Resolved\")\nstart=t.index(\"The deferred evidence check in migration\")\nend=t.index(\"\\n## Runtime Evidence and Limits\",start)\nt=t[:start]+\"\"\"The initial deferred evidence check in migration `0011` compared identity,\nartifact, block, precision, character range, ownership and document identity,\nbut omitted `assertion_evidence.page` and `bbox` against the retained\n`verified_evidence.selector`. This violated the approved mirrored-field\ninvariant for newly inserted evidence. The repaired guard now compares nullable\npage exactly and uses null-normalized JSON bbox equality. Real coordinates\nremain exact; SQL NULL and JSON null represent the same absent bbox. This\nrestores the approved requirement without changing schema semantics.\n\nIndependent source re-review and\n[17 passing PostgreSQL migration cases](artifacts/test-results/g3-evidence-tamper-final.xml)\nclose the finding: four INSERT-tamper cases reject changed/absent page or bbox\nwith zero effects, and three positive cases retain honest PDF and regionless\nTRANSCRIBED CSV evidence with SQL NULL/JSON-null bbox. All existing migration,\nimmutability, correction-contract and downgrade cases also pass in that run.\n\nThe [red run](artifacts/test-results/g3-evidence-tamper-red.xml) exposed all four\nexpected missing-rejection failures plus two initial positive-fixture failures.\nThe [intermediate run](artifacts/test-results/g3-evidence-tamper-green.xml)\nproved the four guard rejections but retained the fixture errors: the supposed\nregionless fixture still had PDF source-location metadata. The corrected\nregionless CSV/TRANSCRIBED fixture passes in the final run. Neither failed\nattempt is represented as passing. The clean full replacement below verifies\nthe repaired source together with existing consumers.\n\n[Runtime migration refresh](artifacts/runtime/migration-carrier-refresh.json)\nrecords the guard deployed on the dedicated runtime database after confirming\nthe v2 surface was empty, with legacy row hashes unchanged.\n\"\"\"+t[end:]\nt=t.replace(\"records the final 290 engine cases,\",\"records the final 297 engine cases,\")\nt=t.replace(\"Earlier focused engine\\nsuites overlap the 290 and are not summed.\",\"Earlier focused engine\\nsuites, including the 148-case feature subset and focused 17 migration cases,\\noverlap the 297 and are not summed. The clean replacement is\\n[g3-carrier-regression-final.xml](artifacts/test-results/g3-carrier-regression-final.xml),\\nwith zero failures, errors or skips.\")\nf.write_text(t)\nf=run/\"artifacts/test-results/architect-conformance-checks.json\";proof=json.loads(f.read_text())\ninv=json.loads((run/\"artifacts/coverage/changed-production-lines.json\").read_text())\nproof[\"sources\"]=[dict(path=x[\"path\"],measured_sha256=x[\"sha256\"],review_sha256=hashlib.sha256((p/x[\"path\"]).read_bytes()).hexdigest()) for x in inv]\nproof[\"source_hash_matches\"]=all(x[\"review_sha256\"]==x[\"measured_sha256\"] for x in proof[\"sources\"])\nassert proof[\"source_hash_matches\"]\nroot=ET.parse(run/\"artifacts/test-results/g3-carrier-regression-final.xml\").getroot()\nsuites=[root] if root.tag==\"testsuite\" else list(root.findall(\"testsuite\"))\ntotals={k:sum(int(s.attrib.get(k,0)) for s in suites) for k in (\"tests\",\"errors\",\"failures\",\"skipped\")}\nassert totals=={\"tests\":297,\"errors\":0,\"failures\":0,\"skipped\":0}\nproof[\"observed_test_results\"][\"g3-carrier-regression-final.xml\"]=totals\nproof[\"observed_test_results\"][\"g3-evidence-tamper-final.xml\"]={\"tests\":17,\"errors\":0,\"failures\":0,\"skipped\":0}\nproof.update(verdict=\"PASS\",reviewed_on=stamp,open_findings={\"critical\":0,\"high\":0,\"medium\":0,\"low\":0})\nf.write_text(json.dumps(proof,indent=2)+\"\\n\")\nprint(\"Architect PASS finalized;A-IMPL-01 resolved;297 clean replacement and20 current hashes verified.\")\n'","exit_code":0,"artifacts":[],"redactions":[]}
